<p>If you email us or submit a story, we store what you send us.</p>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>Cookies are small files stored on your device. Analytics cookies help us improve the site. You can block cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>We may show ads from third-party ad networks. These networks may use cookies to show relevant ads. Their own privacy policies apply.</p>
